{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"一、元年，春王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"二、二月癸亥朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"三、天王使叔服來會葬。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"其言來會葬何？會葬禮也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"四、夏四月丁巳，葬我君僖公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"五、天王使毛伯來錫公命。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"錫者何？賜也。命者何？加我服也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"六、晉侯伐衞。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"七、叔孫得臣如京師。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"八、衞人伐晉。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"九、秋，公孫敖會晉侯于戚。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"十、冬十月丁未，楚世子商臣弒其君髠。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_97_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_97","textTraditional":"十一、公孫敖如齊。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}